schema: signal
object:
  title: Anonymous crypto donors break thank-you and tax-receipt workflows
  type: signal
  signal_type: content
  affected_layer: layer-3-resource-graph
  interpretation: >-
    The article flags, quoting a nonprofit resource, that "many
    cryptocurrency donations arrive with no donor name attached, only a
    wallet address ... this anonymity makes it nearly impossible to send a
    proper tax receipt or a thank-you." Operational gap worth surfacing to
    any local node adopting Giveth or a similar zero-fee donation rail: plan
    a donor-name-capture step (a follow-up form, a Discord role) before
    relationships depend on it.
  proposed_intervention: flag
  maturity: raw
  ai_assisted: true
  provenance:
    origin: src/content/docs/giveth-donations.md
    transformation: summarized
    authorship: ai-assisted
